<title>UK: WestHyp sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>WestHyp sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Sal Oppenheim and GZB Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFALISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **5.0	 MATURITY  **30.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.95    PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	LISTING    DUES	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL 29.JUL.02 THEN STEPS UP TO 7.0 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		HYPOTHEKENPFANDBRIEFE SERIES 4203</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
